      "decision": "considered",
      "rationale": "Retrieved card and primary benchmark section2.3 line17 inspected. Flattening is a broader alternative to compression but carries learned projection cost; no local transfer evidence. Prior usage consideration is provenance, not support, and latest feedback extension failed against its bridge.",
